# doq: emptied 2026-09-05, previous translation failed check.py
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once one or more PUBs are sent to a QPU for execution and a job successfully completes, the data is returned as a [`PrimitiveResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult) container object. The `PrimitiveResult` contains an iterable list of [`PubResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PubResult) objects that contain the execution results for each PUB. For example, a job submitted with 20 PUBs will return a `PrimitiveResult` object that contains a list of 20 `PubResults`, one corresponding to each PUB.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each of these `PubResult` objects possess both a `data` and an optional `metadata` attribute. The `data` attribute is a customized [`DataBin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.DataBin) that contains the the expectation value estimates in case of the Estimator, or samples of the circuit output in the case of the Sampler.\n"
msgstr "לכל אחד מאובייקטי `PubResult` יש גם מאפיין `data` וגם מאפיין `metadata` אופציונלי. מאפיין ה-`data` הוא [`DataBin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.DataBin) מותאם אישית המכיל את הערכות ערך הציפייה במקרה של Estimator, או דגימות של פלט ה-Circuit במקרה של Sampler.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `data` attribute might also include other implementation-specific information such as standard deviations. The `metadata` attribute can contain additional implementation-specific information about the execution of the associated PUB.\n"
msgstr "מאפיין ה-`data` עשוי להכיל גם מידע ספציפי למימוש כגון סטיות תקן. מאפיין ה-`metadata` יכול להכיל מידע ספציפי למימוש נוסף על ביצוע ה-PUB המשויך.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following is a visual outline of the `PrimitiveResult` data structure:\n"
msgstr "להלן מתווה חזותי של מבנה הנתונים `PrimitiveResult`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"estimator\" label=\"Estimator output\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"estimator\" label=\"Estimator output\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    └── PrimitiveResult\n"
"        ├── PubResult[0]\n"
"        │   ├── metadata\n"
"        │   └── data  ## In the form of a DataBin object,\n"
"        |       |     ## which includes data such as the following:\n"
"        │       ├── evs\n"
"        │       │   └── List of estimated expectation values in the shape\n"
"        |       |         specified by the first pub\n"
"        │       └── stds\n"
"        │           └── List of calculated standard deviations in the\n"
"        |                 same shape as above\n"
"        ├── PubResult[1]\n"
"        |   ├── metadata\n"
"        |   └── data  ## In the form of a DataBin object,\n"
"        |       |     ## which includes data such as the following:\n"
"        |       ├── evs\n"
"        |       │   └── List of estimated expectation values in the shape\n"
"        |       |        specified by the second pub\n"
"        |       └── stds\n"
"        |           └── List of calculated standard deviations in the\n"
"        |                same shape as above\n"
"        ├── ...\n"
"        ├── ...\n"
"        └── ...\n"
"    ```\n"
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"    The above is an example of data that might be returned.  The actual data returned depends on the implementation.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
